(7472377, 1186804, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quick note on the picture size - you can have up to 1200 pixels on the long edge, so you could make this taller if you wanted.  If you have questions on how to do that, just ask in a forum.  I tend to make my vertical entries less than the maximum so those with smaller screens don''t have to scroll.  I like the knobby-knee''d guy in the foreground.  :)</td>', 'Quick note on the picture size - you can have up to 1200 pixels on the long edge, so you could make this taller if you wanted.  If you have questions on how to do that, just ask in a forum.  I tend to make my vertical entries less than the maximum so those with smaller screens don''t have to scroll.  I like the knobby-knee''d guy in the foreground.  :)', '2016-09-05 20:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472378, 1186284, 30982, '<td valign="top">Way to take full advantage of an awesome sky.</td>', 'Way to take full advantage of an awesome sky.', '2016-09-05 20:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472379, 1186444, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the feet!  I especially like how they only vaguely resolve into people.  Nice touch with the sun(s) and wee bits of flare, too.</td>', 'Love the feet!  I especially like how they only vaguely resolve into people.  Nice touch with the sun(s) and wee bits of flare, too.', '2016-09-05 20:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
