(7472390, 1186077, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very fun.  I like the pastel''ish handling of this, and the crispness of all the lines.  Mostly, though, I really like his arms out, to enhance his flight.  And her bare feet.  Very nicely seen.</td>', 'Very fun.  I like the pastel''ish handling of this, and the crispness of all the lines.  Mostly, though, I really like his arms out, to enhance his flight.  And her bare feet.  Very nicely seen.', '2016-09-05 20:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472392, 1186508, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the composition, and the choice to go B&amp;W.</td>', 'I quite like the composition, and the choice to go B&W.', '2016-09-05 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
