(7527158, 1186245, 63398, '<td valign="top">Love this! When <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=124190" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LoVi</a> and I went, I couldn''t imagine a typical tourist shot. Glad to see someone else saw it as I did. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1096831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1847/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1096831.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1847/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1096831.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1847/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1096831.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Dunno why I didn''t see this before. Lovely!</td>', 'Love this! When  LoVi and I went, I couldn''t imagine a typical tourist shot. Glad to see someone else saw it as I did.    Dunno why I didn''t see this before. Lovely!', '2017-08-05 10:22:21.000000', NULL, 0);
